//! The `text-autospace` [CSS](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS) property allows you
//! to specify the space applied between Chinese/Japanese/Korean (CJK) and non-CJK characters.
//!
//! Initial: normal. Inherited: yes.
//! Percentages: not accepted.
//!
//! Grammar: normal | <autospace> | auto
//!
//! Specification: https://drafts.csswg.org/css-text-4/#propdef-text-autospace
//!
//! Author guide:
//! https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Properties/text-autospace
